{"version":1,"content":"<p>【黃頁你見過未 !? 😂】近日，NVIDIA 執行長黃仁勳接受專訪時，回憶了一段鮮為人知的創業秘辛。</p><p>他透露，在 1990 年代創立 NVIDIA 時只是一家新創小公司，為了尋求晶圓代工產能，他曾翻閱工商電話簿「黃頁」（Yellow Pages）致電台積電（TSMC）美國辦公室，但多次致電均無人接聽，每次都轉駁至電話答錄機，留下的語音訊息亦石沉大海。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:39:39.782154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:20:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:17:38.508397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:36.435374+00:00","content_hash":"85daef35414393a7c5d13c1c0600a29da543d73675c9fd7749c0cbf765d0df05","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}